    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5a\"><p><strong>5a</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span> cm</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5b\"><p><strong>5b</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>The direction of the particle’s velocity is upwards and the direction of the particle’s acceleration is downwards.</p>\n<p>Therefore the particle is moving upwards and is slowing down.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5c\"><p><strong>5c</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>From the graph, the time period of the wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> ms</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7.2 = \\frac{\\lambda}{100 \\times 10^{-3}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda = 0.72\"></span> m</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5d\"><p><strong>5d</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi\"></span> or <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"180^{\\circ}\"></span></p>\n<p></p></section>"
