  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows how the displacement of a particle in a medium varies with time as a transverse wave passes through the medium.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>a. State the amplitude of the wave.</p>\n<p>    [1]</p>\n<p>b. Describe the particle's motion at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 120\"></span> ms.</p>\n<p>   [2]</p>\n<p>The speed of the wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7.2\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>c. Calculate the wavelength of the wave.</p>\n<p>  [2]</p>\n<p> The horizontal distance between two points on the wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"108\"></span> cm. </p>\n<p>d. State the phase difference of these two points.</p>\n<p>   [1]</p>"
  },
